  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "甘味が　強い　調味料。パルデアでは　甘みが　しっかりと主張しているものが　好まれる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단맛이 강한 조미료. 팔데아에서는 단맛이 잘 두드러지는 것이 선호된다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甜味強勁的調味料。在帕底亞地區，能明顯嚐到甜味的食物相當受歡迎。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût très sucré. Il semblerait que sa popularité à Paldea dépende de son taux de sucre : plus il y en a, mieux c’est !",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein sehr süßes Würzmittel, dessen Popularität in Paldea von der Höhe des Zuckergehalts abhängt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "En Paldea, este ingrediente de sabor dulce es más popular cuanto más azúcar lleve.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento molto dolce. A Paldea si apprezzano le varietà in cui la componente dolce è preponderante.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very sweet condiment. Folks in Paldea seem to love the varieties that really let the sweetness sing.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甘味が　強い　調味料。パルデアでは　甘みが　しっかりと主張しているものが　好まれる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甜味强烈的调味料。在帕底亚，甜味突出的东西会受到欢迎。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
